    <briefdescription>
<para>Pricing engine for 2D European Baskets. </para>    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>This class implements formulae from &quot;Options on the Minimum or the Maximum of Two Risky Assets&quot;, Rene Stulz, Journal of Financial Ecomomics (1982) 10, 161-185.</para><para><xrefsect id="test_1_test000098"><xreftitle>Tests</xreftitle><xrefdescription><para>the correctness of the returned value is tested by reproducing results available in literature. </para></xrefdescription></xrefsect></para>    </detaileddescription>
